================================================================================
INSPIRATION
================================================================================

HexWin takes its interaction model from Hex (https://github.com/kitlangton/Hex),
a dictation app for macOS, along with its choice of engine — Parakeet rather
than Whisper. No code is taken from it: Hex is written in Swift.
